[TITLE]
Minimal SWMM 5.x .inp fixture for swmm-breach round-trip tests.
A single TABULAR storage node representing a Teton-scale reservoir.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CMS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE

