TetonRes         900.0    87.0       87.0        TABULAR    TetonStorage                 0        0

[CURVES]
;;Name           Type       X-Value    Y-Value
;;-------------- ---------- ---------- ----------
TetonStorage     STORAGE    0          0
TetonStorage                20         12000000
TetonStorage                40         60000000
